SPDX expression: ``LGPL-3.0-or-later OR AGPL-3.0-or-later``.

Recipient picks. Most users embedding the connector in a self-hosted
Odoo deployment will find LGPL-3.0-or-later sufficient. The
AGPL-3.0-or-later option exists primarily to enable upstream
distribution via the Odoo Community Association's
``account-fiscal-rule`` repository, which requires AGPL-3.

Contributors agree their contributions are licensed under both
options (see ``CONTRIBUTING.md``).

